### 👨‍💻 About Me

- 🔭 **Current Full-Time Role**: QA Tester @ **Silent Witness AI** (Automated software QA verification, crash telematics, accident report PDFs & dataset curation).
- 🚀 **Venture**: Co-Founder & Lead Engineer @ **RCL Fleet Intelligence** (Real-time GPS telematics & 2-way vehicle tracking platform).
- 🤖 **AI/ML Work**: Lead Developer on **Salma AI** & CTO at **MyMagicBook AI** (LLMs, RAG, Stable Diffusion, FastAPI & PyTorch).
- 💻 **Tech Stacks**: React, Next.js, TypeScript, Python, Node.js, PHP 8.2+ / Laravel 11, PrestaShop 8, PostgreSQL, Docker.
- 🌐 **Official Website**: [samyakli.dev](https://samyakli.dev)

